  "solution": "Given:\n\nx² + (1)/(x²)=7\n\nCalculation:\n\n(x + (1)/(x))2 = x² + (1)/(x²) + 2\n\n⇒ (x + (1)/(x))2 = 7 + 2\n\n⇒ (x + (1)/(x))2 = 9\n\n⇒ x + (1)/(x) = 3\n\nNow (x + (1)/(x))3 = x3 + frac {1}{x³} + 3(x + (1)/(x))\n\n⇒ 33 = x3 + frac {1}{x³} + 3 × 3\n\n⇒ x3 + frac {1}{x³} = 27 - 9 = 18",
